        "official_en_sha256": "c541edbabda5c216eac9628a0c014968e2ad8bd6f7a535e406ca34284eaf3551"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "けど、町の人が義賊を口にしているってことは……。",
        "official_en": "That said, I guess some of the townsfolk aren’t as understanding if they’re hoping for a noble thief to bail them out.",
        "real_en": "But if the townspeople are talking about the noble thief, that means..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
