        "official_en_sha256": "afe2c97ce0f19e65a6e24d617678ea31ccb25a0384e54916986c07d6c98dd156"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その事件の翌日には\r\n親のいない子供たちの施設に食べ物が届けられたのです。",
        "official_en": "And the following day, a pile of food was anonymously dropped off at the local orphanage. Seemingly by the thief.",
        "real_en": "The day after the theft, food was delivered to a home for children without parents."
      },
