      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その義賊……。\r\nロランという男はナシャトにいるはずだ。\r\n彼に会ってみようと思う。",
        "official_en": "Yes... His name is Rolan, and he resides in Felicitas, which is why I believe we should go there to see him.",
        "real_en": "That noble thief... His name is Rolan. He should be in Felicitas. I'd like to speak with him."
      },
