      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、彼らにとって盗まれた金は\r\n都合が悪い金だったようでな。",
        "official_en": "However, as the soldier said, the merchants were dishonest; the stolen money appeared to have been acquired through illicit means.",
        "real_en": "But it seems the money they'd lost was money they didn't want anyone looking into."
      },
