        "official_en_sha256": "2951c45908c81bf19004217e41a2fc10b8bb3f90a1f1b3c68457769cf8239a2e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "グランシェルトからの支援がはじまると、\r\n義賊は姿を消してしまいましたが。",
        "official_en": "Yes. Though the thief never appeared again after the Crown started supporting the orphanage.",
